                "title": "Q552 (Apr. 12, 2024)",
                "question": "If I play this follower after I've already played a Commander card this turn, does the next Commander card I play cost 1 less?",
                "answer": "No. The next Commander card you play would be the second Commander card you play that turn, not the first."
              }
